step	1	-	After starting the quest
step	2	-	After bringing the parchment to Olaf
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Olaf</col> thinks the <col=800000>parchment I found</col> references <col=800000>treasure</col> that would have been lost when the fleet that sailed to Acheron encountered <col=800000>trouble</col> on their return home. He believes the ships will be wrecked around <col=800000>Weissmere</col>, but won't go there himself. He's suggested I bring the <col=800000>parchment</col> to his son, <col=800000>Volf Olafson near the Rellekka Helmet Shop</col>, and see if he wants to search for the <col=800000>treasure on Weissmere</col>.</col>
step	3	-	After giving the parchment to Volf
line	<str>I spoke to Olaf in his camp outside of Rellekka about a parchment I found by following the treasure map he gave me. He believed it was connected to a fleet that sailed to Acheron and may contain treasure, but he himself wasn't willing to go and find it. He instead directed me to his son, Volf, who may be interested in finding the treasure.</str>
line	<col=000080>I've given <col=800000>Volf</col> the <col=800000>parchment</col>. I should check with him and see what he thinks about it.</col>
step	4	-	After talking to Volf some more
line	<str>I spoke to Olaf in his camp outside of Rellekka about a parchment I found by following the treasure map he gave me. He believed it was connected to a fleet that sailed to Acheron and may contain treasure, but he himself wasn't willing to go and find it. He instead directed me to his son, Volf, who may be interested in finding the treasure.</str>
line	<col=000080>Having given <col=800000>Volf</col> the <col=800000>parchment</col>, he's become determined to <col=800000>go to Weissmere</col> and become an explorer like <col=800000>his father</col>.</col>
