line	<str>I spoke to Olaf in his camp outside of Rellekka about a parchment I found by following the treasure map he gave me. He believed it was connected to a fleet that sailed to Acheron and may contain treasure, but he himself wasn't willing to go and find it. He instead directed me to his son, Volf, who may be interested in finding the treasure.</str>
